        "cooked": "<p>So I was looking at the back of the Villains manual, where it shows first villain turn, first hero turn, second villain turn, etc. and I recognized that the art was from the cards in this set. So I went on a little hunt to find which cards the art is pulled from.</p><p>One problem, the Third Hero, i think, is Visionary (and Dark Visionary at that) I could not find that picture anywhere in the cards that came with Villains, I'm sure its in there somewhere, right?</p><p>Could anyone help?</p>",
